   "body": "Release 2026-11-22 20:09\n\n## Changes\n\n### Fix\n\n- query-core: prevent array matching plain object in partialMatchKey (#12651) (08de6c5a8) by @TbhVishal\n- query-core: release queries replaced by QueriesObserver.setQueries (#12658) (0538c9833) by @duncanhope\n- query-core/queriesObserver: pass query hashes when combining in … (#12633) (78432497d) by @yashhbeladiya\n- query-core: prevent render loops from optimistic query results (#12649) (a1e24973a) by @TkDodo\n- query-core: keep a placeholder that select maps to undefined (#12575) (6b849cff2) by @mooxl\n\n### Refactor\n\n- query-core: share array helper for infinite queries (#12677) (3e36f30e0) by @TkDodo\n\n\n## Packages\n\n- @tanstack/angular-query@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/angular-query-devtools@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/angular-query-persist-client@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/eslint-plugin-query@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/lit-query@0.2.43\n- @tanstack/preact-query@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/preact-query-devtools@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/preact-query-persist-client@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/query-async-storage-persister@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/query-broadcast-client-experimental@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/query-core@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/query-devtools@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/query-persist-client-core@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/query-sync-storage-persister@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/react-query@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/react-query-devtools@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/react-query-next-experimental@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/react-query-persist-client@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/solid-query@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/solid-query-devtools@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/solid-query-persist-client@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/svelte-query@6.4.6\n- @tanstack/svelte-query-devtools@6.4.6\n- @tanstack/svelte-query-persist-client@6.4.6\n- @tanstack/vue-query@5.108.3\n- @tanstack/vue-query-devtools@6.4.6\n",
